### ASP.NET Core MVC .NET 8: Complete Sidebar Navigation Tutorial

This tutorial will help you extend your existing ASP.NET Core MVC application with a modern, responsive sidebar while preserving your existing Light Mode / Dark Mode theme toggle using Local Storage.

The implementation is designed for an internal business application, such as an employee management system, supplier evaluation system, approval workflow, or reporting dashboard.

We'll use Bootstrap 5, Razor Views, CSS variables, JavaScript, and ASP.NET Core MVC routing. SQL Server and IIS remain part of your existing application architecture; you do not need to change your database or hosting configuration just to add the sidebar.

